  "notes": "The upper keep is a three-storey white limewashed masonry donjon, with a grey fully hipped slate roof and splayed small openings. Bastion walls are battered rough stone with planted crests. Lower support buildings use white cladding, red tile on the commandant’s residence, and grey roofing on the magazine."
